// WDigest UseLogonCredential Enabled (Cleartext Credential Staging)
// Detects the registry change that forces Windows to keep cleartext credentials in LSASS memory again. Attackers set this, wait for users to re-authenticate, then dump. The write itself is the early warning, well before the dump.
// techniques: T1112   severity: critical
// source: rules/credential-access/wdigest-cleartext-enabled.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
Event
| where ((TargetObject endswith "\\WDigest\\UseLogonCredential") and (Details =~ "DWORD (0x00000001)"))
